  "interpretation": {
    "platform_contract": "Windows development host uses per-user Docker Desktop Linux containers; architecture/RID is not specified by Issue/design or inferred from runner.",
    "digest_choice": "Pinning a verified top-level index/list digest preserves per-platform selection for that exact index. Pinning a child manifest digest selects that specific platform (for example amd64). Do not introduce amd64 as requirement.",
    "source_requirement": "Issue/design require fixing registry/source references and version/digest. They do not state a mandatory SLSA/cryptographic source-commit-to-image attestation. Record existing provenance where available as stronger evidence, not a new blocker.",
    "external_source": "Docker Hub tag/repository APIs expose exact repository/tag/index digest/platform children. Repository source fields are null; Game Controller repository description links upstream GitHub, which is not an attestation for the tag."
  },
